    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHFF82EB281B31E3C529D19511FC5D3D2A" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>
          <span style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px;">Relates to the establishment of a regulatory liability as a result of the U.S. tax reform legislation dated December 22, 2017.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH3FA302DE0C066C62CB2693449A39F428" xlink:to="HHFF82EB281B31E3C529D19511FC5D3D2A" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHA5752A76C5AB619306C0F75E7FDB2708" xlink:label="HHA5752A76C5AB619306C0F75E7FDB2708" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHBFF8BA77F103C3F88838E85A5DF88DF4" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>
          <span style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px;">Algonquin Gas Transmission estimates that the Deferred Income Tax Adjustment Gross-Up would not be included in the development of jurisdictional rates.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHA5752A76C5AB619306C0F75E7FDB2708" xlink:to="HHBFF8BA77F103C3F88838E85A5DF88DF4" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH9BC7D5A92B59A328BEC0774C740FDFF5" xlink:label="HH9BC7D5A92B59A328BEC0774C740FDFF5" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH7CB4CFB6A6A4E007E921DBE56CEE521E" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>All system balancing gas recorded under the fixed asset method as defined by FERC Order 581. System gas volumes needed for load balancing, no notice transportation and other operational purposes is recorded in account 117.2 (current portion). For purposes of accounting for encroachment resulting from line inventory changes, we used Account 117.4 with appropriate debits to Account 808.1 and credits to Account 808.2.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
